-- Quiz Night's starter bank, rewritten for slice 9's rounds: questions that make people think, each with a hook for
-- its reveal. The old starter questions (direct recall) are retired, not deleted (games that asked them keep their
-- keys); the picture questions stay.
--
-- Every grounded question was checked against its Wikipedia article: the quote is the article's own text (fetched,
-- not written from memory), and it backs the marked answer. Order and mix questions were checked item by item against
-- each item's article; the quote is the one that matters most. Brain teasers are ungrounded by design: their answer
-- comes from the puzzle, and each was checked by hand for a single right answer.

update content.quiz_bank set status = 'retired' where origin = 'seed' and kind <> 'picture';

